# The CI speed rule (PR #1188), enforced by `scripts/check-ci-speed.mjs`
# (`data/meta/ci-gates/check-ci-speed.lino`). Documented in docs/ci-cd/speed.md.
#
# - No job or step runs longer than limit-minutes; target-minutes is the aim.
#   Every job declares a timeout-minutes at or under the limit, and no job's
#   measured maximum in data/meta/ci-durations.lino is above it.
# - Long work starts first. A job whose measured median is at or above
#   long-job-minutes waits only on jobs whose outputs, results or artifacts it
#   uses; test shards are planned longest-first by shard-planner from recorded
#   durations, and every sharded-suite runs through it.
# - Sharding loses nothing: the plan puts every listed test in exactly one shard.
#
# A job that cannot meet the limit yet is an over-limit-job under its workflow,
# with the cap it may keep and the reason. The list only shrinks: an entry whose
# job meets the limit again, or no longer exists, fails the gate until removed.
ci-speed
  issue 1188
  temporary-profile critical-coding-release
    recorded "2026-10-27"
    deferred "duplicate native/browser instrumented coverage; no measurement credit"
    restore "coverage dispatch full-coverage=true or FORMAL_AI_FULL_COVERAGE=run"
    retained "normal Linux Rust/JS/specification/browser E2E, coding/reporting, three-client first/repeat, lifecycle, authenticated cleanup and public download checks"
    replay-deferred "noncritical recorded scenarios, long method-learning and computer-record legs"
    replay-restore "FORMAL_AI_FULL_AGENT_REPLAY=run; routing-changing pull requests retain full replay"
    documentation "docs/ci-cd/speed.md"
  limit-minutes 30
  target-minutes 15
  long-job-minutes 10
  durations "data/meta/ci-durations.lino"
  test-durations "data/meta/test-durations.lino"
  javascript-test-durations "data/meta/javascript-test-durations.lino"
  playwright-test-durations "data/meta/playwright-test-durations.lino"
  shard-planner "scripts/plan-test-shards.mjs"
  sharded-suite "scripts/run-prebuilt-tests.sh"
  sharded-suite "scripts/run-coverage-shard.sh"
  sharded-suite ".github/workflows/release.yml"
  sharded-suite ".github/workflows/layered-ci.yml"
  sharded-suite ".github/workflows/e2e-local.yml"
  workflow ".github/workflows/dependencies-latest.yml"
    over-limit-job update
      timeout-minutes 90
      reason "Weekly schedule and dispatch only: updates every dependency, then builds and tests the whole crate in one job."
  workflow ".github/workflows/external-benchmarks.yml"
    over-limit-job external-benchmarks
      timeout-minutes 90
      reason "Schedule and dispatch only (skipped on pull requests, which run the ratchet): runs the upstream suites, 21.2 minutes at most on main. To meet 30: run the sharded upstream-shard path on schedule too."
    over-limit-job upstream-shard
      timeout-minutes 45
      reason "Dispatch with a shard size only: one window of the upstream suites. To meet 30: size the windows from measured durations."
  workflow ".github/workflows/macos-core-tests.yml"
    over-limit-job build-archive
      timeout-minutes 55
      reason "Switched off while non-Linux CI is off (issue #1111): a cold build of the macOS test archive. To meet 30: build the archive from a shared compiler cache on the Linux build job's schedule."
  workflow ".github/workflows/hive-original-delivery.yml"
    over-limit-job delivery
      timeout-minutes 55
      reason "Issue #1364: owner40173640886 job121114230265 spent28m13s before solve (08:04:29Z to08:32:42Z on2026-10-25), leaving only1m47s under the old30-minute parent for its bounded21-minute solve. Temporary image-transfer debt: allow55 minutes for observed setup plus solve and5-minute evidence reserve; retain all operation limits and single-attempt ownership. Remove after source-bound image handoff plus solve fits30 minutes."
  workflow ".github/workflows/release-staged.yml"
    over-limit-job "auto_publish-verify-images"
      timeout-minutes 90
      reason "Issue #1201: restore retained source image allowance after run38445988819 job115507882265 reached at least1816s before parent cancellation during DockerHub mirroring (rawSHA2bbf7c5930c6b067e9109bf8ec6410ddd2e0d8de7cbc9604211b6e155fea71f9). Temporary debt: split full/slim/mirror publication into source-bound stages and remove this exception once each fits30 minutes; per-operation limits remain unchanged."
    over-limit-job "manual_publish-verify-images"
      timeout-minutes 90
      reason "Issue #1201: restore retained source image allowance after run38445988819 job115507882265 reached at least1816s before parent cancellation during DockerHub mirroring (rawSHA2bbf7c5930c6b067e9109bf8ec6410ddd2e0d8de7cbc9604211b6e155fea71f9). Temporary debt: split full/slim/mirror publication into source-bound stages and remove this exception once each fits30 minutes; per-operation limits remain unchanged."
  workflow ".github/workflows/desktop-release.yml"
    over-limit-job native
      timeout-minutes 45
      reason "PR #1202 Intel native cold-build restoration debt: run38694221188 job116289014825 exhausted its30-minute parent after1629s of cold default-feature compilation; cache restore missed and gtar failed because release/deps changed while orphan cargo/rustc remained alive (decodedLogSHA5228190b36a1b72ccd6c7c91d1f9f08c3d7c191f8c08bcfa66cb9fe0ffc5012c). Temporary45-minute Intel-only cap with enforced2100s process-group budget; restore30 after splitting or proving the unchanged cold build fits, with successful cache sealing and real receipt/runtime checks."
